WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
This kettle is rated
two thousand watts.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.290
This television, just one hundred.

3
00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.350
The kettle transfers
energy far faster.

4
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.510
So does it cost more to run?

5
00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.970
The kettle is on for
a few minutes a day.

6
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.590
The television is often on for hours.

7
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.930
In this mission, you'll compare
the energy stored in foods and

8
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:22.830
fuels, and find out where the
energy for your home comes from.

9
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.410
You'll learn what power means,

10
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.950
and how energy companies
measure what you use.

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.990
Your mission: work out whether
the kettle or the television

12
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.900
costs more to run.
